WEBVTT

00:09:27.713 --> 00:09:30.544
The one and one, the two and two.

00:09:30.884 --> 00:09:32.433
Isn't that beautiful?

00:09:32.953 --> 00:09:34.822
And easy, of course.

00:09:34.822 --> 00:09:37.393
For me, the question was:

00:09:37.393 --> 00:09:43.513
How can I have my life
this similarly easy and beautiful?

00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:51.434
For me these two symmetrical numbers
reflect the outside me and the inside me.

00:09:52.554 --> 00:09:56.464
I can live in harmony, I can live in peace


00:09:56.464 --> 00:10:00.492
only when my outside
matches my inner being.